# 🐍 Python Time Complexity Cheat Sheet

A quick reference for the time complexity of common Python operations and methods.

---

# 📌 List Operations

| Operation | Example | Average Case | Worst Case |
|-----------|----------|--------------|-------------|
| Access by Index | `lst[i]` | O(1) | O(1) |
| Set by Index | `lst[i] = x` | O(1) | O(1) |
| Append | `lst.append(x)` | O(1) | O(n) |
| Pop Last | `lst.pop()` | O(1) | O(1) |
| Pop at Index | `lst.pop(i)` | O(n) | O(n) |
| Insert | `lst.insert(i, x)` | O(n) | O(n) |
| Delete | `del lst[i]` | O(n) | O(n) |
| Remove Value | `lst.remove(x)` | O(n) | O(n) |
| Search | `x in lst` | O(n) | O(n) |
| Extend | `lst.extend(lst2)` | O(k) | O(k) |
| Concatenation | `lst1 + lst2` | O(n+k) | O(n+k) |
| Slice | `lst[a:b]` | O(k) | O(k) |
| Reverse | `lst.reverse()` | O(n) | O(n) |
| Copy | `lst.copy()` | O(n) | O(n) |
| Sort | `lst.sort()` | O(n log n) | O(n log n) |

