# 📌 Set Operations

| Operation | Example | Average Case | Worst Case |
|-----------|----------|--------------|-------------|
| Add | `s.add(x)` | O(1) | O(n) |
| Remove | `s.remove(x)` | O(1) | O(n) |
| Discard | `s.discard(x)` | O(1) | O(n) |
| Pop | `s.pop()` | O(1) | O(n) |
| Search | `x in s` | O(1) | O(n) |
| Union | `s1 | s2` | O(len(s1)+len(s2)) | O(n) |
| Intersection | `s1 & s2` | O(min(n,m)) | O(nm) |
| Difference | `s1 - s2` | O(len(s1)) | O(nm) |
| Symmetric Difference | `s1 ^ s2` | O(len(s1)+len(s2)) | O(nm) |

